   var detail = fetchError && fetchError.message ? fetchError.message : String(fetchError);
   console.error('Failed to fetch questions, continuing without file:', detail);
   ```
   With a JS Error('jira down...'), detail = 'jira down...'. In the node testRunner, same. Good.

